title: "Claudius: the Claude pack for Git Crafter"
abstract: "Claudius sets up the Claude desktop app as an autonomous, agentic system: you give the objective and the vision, and Claude plans, builds, reviews and merges on its own, asking you only about vision, billing, a one-way change or a step the platform forces."
